id: pm-http-tcwp
title: "Deep CI fails changelog:check: the 2026.11.20 section date no longer matches the release tag date"
description: "The deep tier fails the changelog gate because the committed 2026.11.20 section is dated 2026-11-20 while the release tag v2026.11.20 was recreated on 2026-11-21 by the second release PR. Regenerate and commit the changelog so the gate passes again. Deterministic: reproduces on any host at the current commit."
type: Issue
