comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-23T15:15:12.310Z",codex-agent,"Classification (scheduled-failure triage 2026-11-23, deep run 45009979278): class 1 - a real, host-independent gate failure. First real failure: deep (22)/(26) jobs failed 'Full npm release gate' at changelog:check, 'Changelog is out of date ... Drift classification: tracker_changed' with the 2026.11.20 section dated 2026-11-20 committed vs 2026-11-21 generated. Root cause: the v2026.11.20 tag was recreated one day later by the second release PR, so the tag-derived section date moved. Reproduced locally on the current main commit (npm run changelog:check exits 1). Fix: commit the regenerated changelog. Revert proof: with the CHANGELOG.md regeneration reverted, changelog:check exits 1 again (the gate is the regression test)."
  "2026-11-23T15:15:57.474Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof: with the regenerated CHANGELOG.md restored to the committed version, npm run changelog:check exits 1 (assertion 'Changelog is out of date ... 2026.11.20 - 2026-11-20 vs 2026-11-21'); with the fix it exits 0. Gates: typecheck pass, lint pass, identity:check 0 violations, changelog:check pass."
